{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間TV見てますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず\n放送されたところまでで\n中田が出演したのをお話しすると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アンダーライブ全国ツアー2016　～東北シリーズ～」の日程が発表されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/19（火）\n福島：福島県文化センター　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/20（水）\n宮城：東京エレクトロンホール宮城"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/21（木）\n岩手：盛岡市民文化ホール　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/22（金）\n青森：八戸市公会堂　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/23（土）\n秋田：秋田市文化会館　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/24（日）\n山形：やまぎんホール（山形県民会館）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は次の準備があって\nこの発表されてる場にいれなかったから\n気持ちをここに書きますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとうに\n楽しみ！！！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これにつきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂電視台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップバッターをやらせてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10分間やりたいことをなんでもやっていいよ\nって言われて\n朝イチから踊らせてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n構成から全部\n自分で考えさせていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"打ち合わせもあまりできずで\nいろいろあったけど\nスタッフさんもいろんな企画でお忙しい中で\n曲を準備してくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事、終わって良かったなーと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとミスあったし\nリベンジしたいんだけどw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当にただの自己満なのに\n見てくださってありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤飛鳥のラジオ体操"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥の後ろで\n若月と中田で正しいラジオ体操をやってたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この後のトークでも言ってたけど\nラジオ体操第一は元々できないから\n一生懸命覚えていったけど\n普通に楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46時間TVバースデーボウリング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、あやつが\n姿を現しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナヲ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、こんな古典的な姿でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4th Anniversary 今、話させたい誰かがいる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら抽選会が終わってて\n飛鳥と中田のサシトークになってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、気づいたら\nまたしてもトップバッター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな事でトークするかわかんないし\n不安だったけど\n全然楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥とだとナチュラルに喋れるから\n相手が飛鳥で良かったな～って思ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂電視台 琴子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにも\nなんかゲストで出させてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めげない\n琴子ちゃんぺろぺろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/20/4074574/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ、まだまだ始まったばっかりじゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}